{"id":"n80561-1-10","stage":3,"title":"파출소 · 派出所","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80561-1-10-1","ko":"너희 오빠는 어떤 일을 하시니?","zh":"你哥哥做什么工作？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오빠는","meaning":"哥哥","explanation":"오빠：哥哥；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오빠","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68006","senseId":"1","lemma":"오빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하시니?","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"14e10e3b73bff854","term":"오빠","zh":"哥哥","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3","entryId":"68006","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["오빠"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c7ae7708995c06c3d6f6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80561-1-10-2","ko":"오빠는 경찰이라 파출소에서 일해.","zh":"我哥哥是警察，在派出所工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오빠는","meaning":"哥哥","explanation":"오빠：哥哥；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오빠","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68006","senseId":"1","lemma":"오빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경찰이라","meaning":"警察","explanation":"경찰：警察；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"경찰","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25949","senseId":"2","lemma":"경찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"파출소에서","meaning":"派出所","explanation":"파출소：派出所；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"파출소","audio":"/audio/6aae3bf4ee06a7977d51.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80561","senseId":"1","lemma":"파출소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일해.","meaning":"工作","explanation":"일하다：工作；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"일하다","audio":"/audio/3313fc8f7aeacdfbc30f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57309","senseId":"2","lemma":"일하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"14e10e3b73bff854","term":"오빠","zh":"哥哥","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3","entryId":"68006","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["오빠"]},{"id":"642315305ad78197","term":"경찰","zh":"警察","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3","entryId":"25949","definition":"负责维持社会秩序、保护人民生命和财产安全的公务员。","pronunciation":["경ː찰"]},{"id":"6aae3bf4ee06a797","term":"파출소","zh":"派出所","audio":"/audio/6aae3bf4ee06a7977d51.mp3","entryId":"80561","definition":"在公安局辖区内，向每个街道派出警官而处理业务的地方。","pronunciation":["파출쏘"]},{